<h1 class='content-title'>My life in five minutes</h1>

<p class='content-paragraph'>
  My parents, and later a few books, taught me that where you start doesn’t decide where you end up.
</p>

<p class='content-paragraph'>
  They were born in <a
    href='https://tr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Re%C5%9Fadiye,_Sand%C4%B1kl%C4%B1'
    target='_blank'
    rel='noopener noreferrer'>Reşadiye</a
  >, a small village in Turkey. They left with almost nothing and built a life in Nancy, France,
  where I was born and raised. They have been my biggest motivation. They still are.
</p>

<p class='content-paragraph'>
  Every year since I was born, we go back to the village. Ninety percent of my family still lives up
  there. It’s the place that reminds me where I come from.
</p>

