<p class='content-paragraph'>
  I grew up in my bedroom with a PlayStation, the family computer, and Turkish music playing in the
  background. One of the first games I ever played was <em class='content-emphasis'
    >Prince of Persia</em
  >, sitting next to my dad. You’d find video games at the top of my wish list every year. I didn’t
  know it at the time, but I was spending my childhood in front of the machines I’d later build
  software for.
</p>

