/>

<p class='content-paragraph'>
  In between, I launched <a
    href='https://databasestory.com'
    target='_blank'
    rel='noopener noreferrer'>DatabaseStory</a
  >, where I interview the best engineers working on databases. Every conversation teaches me
  something I couldn’t have learned in a classroom.
</p>

<BioGallery items={[{ src: '/bio/databasestory.jpg', alt: 'DatabaseStory' }]} />

<p class='content-paragraph'>
  There’s still a lot to do. I’m excited for the next decade, and I want to make my parents proud.
</p>

<p class='content-paragraph'>
  I didn’t plan any of this. But I’m damn proud of the path. I’m incredibly grateful to my parents,
  to a Turkish teacher who handed me a book, and to those strangers on the internet who showed me I
  could build anything.
</p>
